<title>USA: Read-Rite names president, COO.</title>
<headline>Read-Rite names president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Read-Rite Corp on Wednesday said it named Alan Lowe named president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>The company said Lowe was succeeding Fred Schwettmann, who was retiring from those posts but staying on the board of directors.</p>
<p>Lowe was formerly senior vice president of customer business units at Read-Rite, which makes recording heads and assemblies for computer disk drives.</p>
